が取得でき次第、ここに自動で表示されます。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"77.7\" width=\"320\" height=\"19.5\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,81.8 9.1,88.3 14.2,85.2 19.3,92.9 24.5,89.1 29.6,85.8 34.7,85.4 39.8,77.7 44.9,80.3 50.0,83.0 55.1,80.9 60.3,76.6 65.4,70.3 70.5,69.8 75.6,65.6 80.7,63.6 85.8,28.1 91.0,30.7 96.1,35.5 101.2,26.5 106.3,17.0 111.4,22.8 116.5,12.8 121.6,28.6 126.8,43.8 131.9,48.8 137.0,47.6 142.1,34.4 147.2,34.4 152.3,31.2 157.4,33.9 162.6,46.7 167.7,54.6 172.8,55.8 177.9,58.1 183.0,56.0 188.1,58.3 193.2,69.7 198.4,83.8 203.5,80.9 208.6,78.8 213.7,82.1 218.8,78.7 223.9,77.0 229.0,72.4 234.2,66.6 239.3,72.4 244.4,65.2 249.5,51.4 254.6,71.8 259.7,68.8 264.9,60.7 270.0,51.0 275.1,44.9 280.2,46.8 285.3,63.4 290.4,62.5 295.5,66.2 300.7,73.0 305.8,75.9 310.9,76.9 316.0,78.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 93.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 93.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 93.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 93.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 93.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 93.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 19.3 104.9 l 5 8 